 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n  <li>A baseball travels <span data-math=\"d\">d</span> meters <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> seconds after being dropped from the top of a building. The distance traveled by the baseball can be modeled by the equation <span data-math=\"d=5t2\">d=5t2</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Use this table to answer questions a – g.&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"os-raise-skinnytable unnumbered\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"t\">t</span> (seconds)</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"d\">d</span> (meters)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>0.5</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1.5</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
